    {
      "text": "A second miniature learning-curve plot inside Figure 4.1, placed at two points in the schematic. Five curves on the same unlabelled 0-50 by 0.0-1.0 axes: red highest and flat near 0.75 from about x=7, orange and green together near 0.48-0.50, purple just below at about 0.43, and blue lowest at about 0.25. Same role as the other two thumbnails — illustrative, not quantitative.",
